 "panels": [
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "id": "oktave-tabs-:Raje6:-panel-ai-agents",
   "role": "tabpanel",
   "state": "",
   "hidden": "",
   "text": "Ship AI agents faster, without losing controlGive AI agents verifiable identities through pre-built SDKs, and control their access to RAG data sources and MCP tools. Authorize your agents to hit paid external services and fetch sensitive data, while keeping a human in the loop for critical transactions.Featured capabilitiesUser authenticationToken VaultAuth for model context protocol (MCP)Asynchronous authorizationAgent as PrincipalFine-Grained Authorization (FGA) for retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)AI Identity for B2BAI Identity for Commerce",
   "imgs": []
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "id": "oktave-tabs-:Raje6:-panel-b2c",
   "role": "tabpanel",
   "state": "",
   "hidden": "",
   "text": "Drive sign-ups with frictionless authenticationDon't let a clunky login screen block growth and revenue. Deploy passwordless, social logins, and adaptive MFA to boost conversion, and safely delegate access so agents can act on a user's behalf.Featured capabilitiesPasswordlessAdaptive AuthenticationAI Identity for CommerceEmbedded LoginProgressive ProfilingBot DetectionExplore B2C customer identity solutions",
   "imgs": []
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "id": "oktave-tabs-:Raje6:-panel-b2b",
   "role": "tabpanel",
   "state": "",
   "hidden": "",
   "text": "Build enterprise-ready auth without the headacheStop burning sprints on custom SAML just to close a contract. Power your B2B SaaS with enterprise SSO and SCIM, manage multi-tenancy support, and enforce fine-grained permissions for both human users and AI agents.Featured capabilitiesEnterprise ConnectionsTenancy-as-a-ServiceAI Identity for B2BMy Organization API and Embeddable UI ComponentsOrganizationsFine-Grained Authorization (FGA)Self-Service Enterprise ConfigurationDiscover Auth0 for B2B SaaS",
   "imgs": []
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "id": "oktave-tabs-:Raje6:-panel-machines",
   "role": "tabpanel",
   "state": "",
   "hidden": "",
   "text": "Secure machine identities & APIs at scaleDon't let long-lived API keys and sprawling service credentials become a compliance liability and attack surface. Issue short-lived tokens via the Client Credentials flow, rotate signing keys automatically through JWKS rotation, and keep every service access auditable and revocable.Featured capabilitiesM2M authenticationFine-Grained Authorization (FGA)Signing Key RotationAPI AuthorizationPrivate Key JSON Web Token (JWT) & mutual TLS (mTLS) Client AuthenticationView internal app security features",
   "imgs": []
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "id": "integrate-auth-panel",
   "role": "tabpanel",
   "state": "",
   "hidden": "",
   "text": "$claude$/plugin install auth0@claude-plugins-official ✓ detected>Add ▋Linstalling @auth0/nextjs-auth0 ✓Lwiring routes + login ✓✓Auth0 is live ∙ ready in 4.2s",
   "imgs": []
  }
 ],
